#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_semantic_segmentation.rst:10
msgid "模型简介"
msgstr "Model introduction"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_semantic_segmentation.rst:12
msgid ""
"语义分割模型对图像中的每个像素进行分类，将图像分割成不同的语义区域。与实例分割不同，语义分割不区分同类物体的不同实例，所有同类像素都被归为同一类别。"
msgstr ""
"Semantic segmentation models classify each pixel in the image and segment "
"the image into different semantic regions.Unlike instance segmentation, "
"semantic segmentation does not distinguish between different instances of "
"the same object, and all pixels of the same type are classified into the "
"same category."

