#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_semantic_segmentation.rst:185
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "FAQ"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_semantic_segmentation.rst:187
msgid "**Q: 语义分割和实例分割的主要区别是什么？**"
msgstr ""
"**Q: What is the main difference between semantic segmentation and instance "
"segmentation?**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_semantic_segmentation.rst:189
msgid "A:"
msgstr "A:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_semantic_segmentation.rst:190
msgid "**语义分割**：只关注\"是什么\"，不区分个体。例如，多辆车都标记为\"car\"类别"
msgstr ""
"**Semantic Segmentation**: Only focus on \"what is\" and do not distinguish "
"between individuals.For example, multiple cars are tagged with the \"car\" "
"category"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_semantic_segmentation.rst:191
msgid "**实例分割**：区分\"是哪个\"，每辆车有独立的ID和掩码"
msgstr ""
"**Instance segmentation**: distinguish \"which one\", each vehicle has an "
"independent ID and mask"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_semantic_segmentation.rst:193
msgid "**选择建议：**"
msgstr "**Selection suggestions:**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_semantic_segmentation.rst:195
msgid "需要区分个体（如计数、跟踪）→ 使用实例分割"
msgstr ""
"Need to distinguish individuals (e.g. counting, tracking) → use instance "
"segmentation"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_semantic_segmentation.rst:196
msgid "只需要区域分类（如可行驶区域、背景分割）→ 使用语义分割"
msgstr ""
"Only area classification is required (e.g. drivable area, background "
"segmentation) → use semantic segmentation"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_semantic_segmentation.rst:198
msgid "**Q: 分割图的像素值代表什么？**"
msgstr "**Q: What do the pixel values ​​of the segmentation map represent?**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_semantic_segmentation.rst:200
msgid "A: 分割图中每个像素的值对应该像素的类别ID（label_id）。例如，值为0的像素属于label_id为0的类别。"
msgstr ""
"A: The value of each pixel in the segmentation map corresponds to the "
"category ID (label_id) of the pixel.For example, a pixel with value 0 "
"belongs to the category with label_id 0."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_semantic_segmentation.rst:202
msgid "**Q: 如何提取特定类别的区域？**"
msgstr "**Q: How to extract areas of a specific category?**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_semantic_segmentation.rst:204
msgid ""
"A: 1. 读取分割图 2. 找到对应类别的label_id 3. 创建二值掩码：mask = (segmentation == label_id) "
"4. 使用该掩码提取原图对应区域"
msgstr ""
"A: 1. Read the segmentation image 2. Find the label_id of the corresponding "
"category 3. Create a binary mask: mask = (segmentation == label_id) 4. Use "
"this mask to extract the corresponding area of ​​the original image"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_semantic_segmentation.rst:210
msgid "**Q: 为什么分割边缘不够平滑？**"
msgstr "**Q: Why are the segmented edges not smooth enough?**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_semantic_segmentation.rst:212
msgid "A: 可能的原因和解决方案："
msgstr "A: Possible causes and solutions:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_semantic_segmentation.rst:214
msgid "模型输出分辨率低：使用更高分辨率的模型"
msgstr "Model output resolution is low: use a higher resolution model"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_semantic_segmentation.rst:215
msgid "图像质量差：提高输入图像质量"
msgstr "Poor image quality: Improve input image quality"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_semantic_segmentation.rst:216
msgid "后处理：使用双边滤波、CRF等优化边缘"
msgstr "Post-processing: Optimize edges using bilateral filtering, CRF, etc."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_semantic_segmentation.rst:218
msgid "**Q: 如何计算某个类别的面积占比？**"
msgstr "**Q: How to calculate the area proportion of a certain category?**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_semantic_segmentation.rst:220
msgid ""
"A: 直接使用输出中的 ``percentage`` 字段，或用 ``pixel_count / (width * height)`` 计算。"
msgstr ""
"A: Use the ``percentage`` field in the output directly, or calculate it with"
" ``pixel_count / (width * height)``."

